<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title><![CDATA[Dvor Ineya]]></title><description><![CDATA[Obsidian digital garden]]></description><link>http://github.com/dylang/node-rss</link><image><url>site-lib/media/favicon.png</url><title>Dvor Ineya</title><link></link></image><generator>Webpage HTML Export plugin for Obsidian</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 20:46:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="site-lib/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 20:45:57 GMT</pubDate><ttl>60</ttl><dc:creator></dc:creator><item><title><![CDATA[Vestniki Zimy]]></title><description><![CDATA[The <a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" data-href="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" href="dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Tsaritsa's</a> personally chosen executors.<br>
<a data-href="Seryy Krai" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/seryy-krai.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Seryy Krai</a> - Lightkeeper/lantern bearer leader (Feofan)<br>
<a data-href="Morskaya Gavan" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/morskaya-gavan.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Morskaya Gavan</a> - Commercial overseer<br>
<a data-href="Ozerograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/ozerograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Ozerograd (Oblast)</a> - Curator of knowledge<br>
<a data-href="Kholodhnograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/kholodhnograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Kholodhnograd (Oblast)</a> - Tsaritsa herself?]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/government/vestniki-zimy.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Government/Vestniki Zimy.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 07:37:49 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dvor Ineya, the Unseelie Court of Frost]]></title><description><![CDATA[Dvor Ineya--also known as the Court of Frost--is the homeland of most <a data-href="Unseelie Fey" href="dvor-ineya/unseelie-fey.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Unseelie Fey</a> in the Material Plane. Governed by the <a data-href="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" href="dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lunnaya Tsaritsa</a>, it is a frigid and mountainous island nation located in the northern reaches of Alteres.While the outer reaches of the nation are more level, the inner regions are highly mountainous, requiring specialized infrastructure to settle. <br>Divided into X <a data-href="Oblasts" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/oblasts.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Oblasts</a> or provinces, Dvor Ineya
Special Mountain? --&gt; curse<br>Headed by the <a data-href="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" href="dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lunnaya Tsaritsa</a> herself, the governing system is divided into 3 branches. <a data-href="The Ecclesiarchy" href="dvor-ineya/government/the-ecclesiarchy.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">The Ecclesiarchy</a> representing religious interests, <a data-href="The Ledyanoy Veche" href="dvor-ineya/government/the-ledyanoy-veche.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">The Ledyanoy Veche</a> representing the peoples voices in legislative matters, and <a data-href="The High Court of Morana" href="dvor-ineya/government/the-high-court-of-morana.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">The High Court of Morana</a> representing the primary judicial authority. The leaders of these branches often have conflicts due to differing interests of the parties they represent, but the Tsaritsa is able to bring balance and resolve these disputes. In addition, each Oblast is represented by a <a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="Vestniki Zimy" data-href="Vestniki Zimy" href="dvor-ineya/government/vestniki-zimy.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Vestnik Zimy</a>. The <a data-href="Vestniki Zimy" href="dvor-ineya/government/vestniki-zimy.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Vestniki Zimy</a> act as instruments of the Tsaritsa's will throughout the land, rooting out treason and corruption.<br>The only deity actively worshipped in Dvor Ineya is the <a data-href="Lady of Dormition" href="dvor-ineya/religion/lady-of-dormition.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lady of Dormition</a>,<br>
represented by the <a data-href="Church of Repose" href="dvor-ineya/religion/church-of-repose.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Church of Repose</a> and the <a data-href="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" href="dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lunnaya Tsaritsa</a> herself.Calamity?]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/dvor-ineya,-the-unseelie-court-of-frost.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Dvor Ineya, the Unseelie Court of Frost.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 07:16:22 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oblasts]]></title><description><![CDATA[The provincial regions of Dvor Ineya. There are X of them:
<a data-href="Kholodhnograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/kholodhnograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Kholodhnograd (Oblast)</a><br>
<a data-href="Morskaya Gavan" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/morskaya-gavan.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Morskaya Gavan</a><br>
<a data-href="Seryy Krai" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/seryy-krai.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Seryy Krai</a><br>
<a data-href="Ozerograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/ozerograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Ozerograd (Oblast)</a> Things to note:<br>
<a data-href="Kholodhnograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/kholodhnograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Kholodhnograd (Oblast)</a> is the capital Oblast of Dvor Ineya.<br>
<a data-href="Ozerograd (Oblast)" href="dvor-ineya/oblasts/ozerograd-(oblast).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Ozerograd (Oblast)</a> is a very small region, acting almost as a city-state.]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/oblasts/oblasts.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Oblasts/Oblasts.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 07:04:24 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Seryy Krai]]></title><description><![CDATA[<a data-href="Zolnyy" href="dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/zolnyy.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Zolnyy</a>]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/oblasts/seryy-krai.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Oblasts/Seryy Krai.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 07:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Morskaya Gavan]]></title><description><![CDATA[The primary region of commerce and global relations. Its provincial capital, <a data-href="Zmei" href="dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/zmei.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Zmei</a>, serves as one of the few large-scale ports that accommodates international travel in all of Dvor Ineya. ]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/oblasts/morskaya-gavan.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Oblasts/Morskaya Gavan.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 07:00:33 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Zmei]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/zmei.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Cities of Note/Zmei.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:53:43 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ozerograd (Oblast)]]></title><description><![CDATA[The smallest oblast, known primarily for the provincial capital--<a data-href="Ozerograd (City)" href="dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/ozerograd-(city).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Ozerograd (City)</a>--from which it gets its name. ]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/oblasts/ozerograd-(oblast).html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Oblasts/Ozerograd (Oblast).md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:47:11 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kholodhnograd (Oblast)]]></title><description><![CDATA[The most significant province of Dvor Ineya. It derives its name from the nation's capital city, <a data-href="Kholodhnograd (City)" href="dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/kholodhnograd-(city).html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Kholodhnograd (City)</a>.]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/oblasts/kholodhnograd-(oblast).html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Oblasts/Kholodhnograd (Oblast).md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:45:28 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kholodhnograd (City)]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/kholodhnograd-(city).html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Cities of Note/Kholodhnograd (City).md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:42:30 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ozerograd (City)]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/ozerograd-(city).html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Cities of Note/Ozerograd (City).md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:42:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Zolnyy]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/cities-of-note/zolnyy.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Cities of Note/Zolnyy.md</guid><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 06:40:45 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lady of Dormition]]></title><description><![CDATA[Honorific Name:
"Our Mother, progenitor of Dreams"
"She who reigns over Rime and Shadow"
"Mistress of Repose and Silence"
"Bringer of Eternal Slumber"]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/religion/lady-of-dormition.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Religion/Lady of Dormition.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 18:32:55 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lightkeepers or Lantern Bearers (tbd)]]></title><link>lightkeepers-or-lantern-bearers-(tbd).html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Lightkeepers or Lantern Bearers (tbd).md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 07:20:38 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Morana]]></title><description><![CDATA[The first envoy of the <a data-href="Lady of Dormition" href="dvor-ineya/religion/lady-of-dormition.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lady of Dormition</a>--and consequently first <a data-href="Lunnaya Tsaritsa" href="dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lunnaya Tsaritsa</a>--who brought order to the warring and chaotic factions of <a data-href="Unseelie Fey" href="dvor-ineya/unseelie-fey.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Unseelie Fey</a> who existed in ancient times.]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/history/morana.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/History/Morana.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:38:44 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lunnaya Tsaritsa]]></title><description><![CDATA[While the current Lunnaya Tsaritsa's reign began shortly after the enlightenment, the title itself can refer to any of its previous holders throughout history. The Lunnaya Tsaritsa's role is not only that of governance, acting as an envoy of the <a data-href="Lady of Dormition" href="dvor-ineya/religion/lady-of-dormition.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lady of Dormition</a> in the material plane. Considered the highest authority in the land, she presides over the three governing bodies, resolving any disputes among them.Tsaritsy of note:<br>
<a data-href="Morana" href="dvor-ineya/history/morana.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Morana</a>, the first Lunnaya Tsaritsa
TBD (Feofan era)
Current tsaritsa]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/government/lunnaya-tsaritsa.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Government/Lunnaya Tsaritsa.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:34:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The High Court of Morana]]></title><description><![CDATA[Named after its creator, the first Tsaritsa <a data-href="Morana" href="dvor-ineya/history/morana.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Morana</a>]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/government/the-high-court-of-morana.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Government/The High Court of Morana.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:31:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Ledyanoy Veche]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/government/the-ledyanoy-veche.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Government/The Ledyanoy Veche.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:15:28 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Ecclesiarchy]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/government/the-ecclesiarchy.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Government/The Ecclesiarchy.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:07:43 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Church of Repose]]></title><description><![CDATA[The organized religion worshipping Our <a data-href="Lady of Dormition" href="dvor-ineya/religion/lady-of-dormition.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Lady of Dormition</a>. ]]></description><link>dvor-ineya/religion/church-of-repose.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Religion/Church of Repose.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 06:02:30 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Unseelie Fey]]></title><link>dvor-ineya/unseelie-fey.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Dvor Ineya/Unseelie Fey.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 04:58:07 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Natsiya Svaroga, the Seelie Nation of the Dawn]]></title><link>natsiya-svaroga/natsiya-svaroga,-the-seelie-nation-of-the-dawn.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">Natsiya Svaroga/Natsiya Svaroga, the Seelie Nation of the Dawn.md</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 03:15:45 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>